Dimensions:**\n  - gridDim.x, gridDim.y = computed from query_stride and log_rows_per_query\n  - blockDim.x = varies (512 >> log_rows_per_query)\n  - blockDim.y = 2^log_rows_per_query\n- **Shared Memory:** `CELLS_OUT * shared_stride * sizeof(Fp)` (used for merkle tree compression)\n\n**Core Algorithm (Lines 39-51 - Row Hashing Phase):**\n```cuda\nif (stride_idx < query_stride) {\n    // compute row hash via sponge\n    for (int col = 0; col < width; col++) {\n        cells[used++] = matrix[col * height + row];  // Load column-major\n        if (used == CELLS_RATE) {  // CELLS_RATE defines permutation rate\n            poseidon2::poseidon2_mix(cells);        // Squeeze phase\n            used = 0;\n        }\n    }\n    if (used != 0) {\n        poseidon2::poseidon2_mix(cells);\n    }\n}\n```\n\n**Merkle Tree Compression (Lines 53-71):**\n```cuda\n// Build binary tree bottom-up using log_rows_per_query layers\nfor (int layer = 0; layer < log_rows_per_query; ++layer) {\n    // Thread cooperation via shared memory\n    if ((leaf_idx & mask) == (1 << layer)) {\n        // Store child hash in shared memory\n        for (int i = 0; i < CELLS_OUT; i++) {\n            shared[i * shared_stride + shared_offset] = cells[i];\n        }\n    }\n    __syncthreads();\n    if ((leaf_idx & mask) == 0) {\n        // Read sibling from shared, hash pair\n        for (int i = 0; i < CELLS_OUT; i++) {\n            cells[CELLS_OUT + i] = shared[i * shared_stride + shared_offset];\n        }\n        poseidon2::poseidon2_mix(cells);  // Compress left+right\n    }\n    __syncthreads();\n}\n```\n\n**Output:** Single root per query (line 73-78)\n- Only thread with `leaf_idx == 0` writes final root\n- `out[stride_idx]` = root hash for query stride_idx\n\n**Launcher:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/merkle_tree.cu` (lines 214-230)\n```cuda\nextern \"C\" int _poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes(\n    digest_t *out,\n    const Fp *matrix,\n    size_t width,\n    size_t query_stride,\n    size_t log_rows_per_query\n) {\n    auto [grid, block] = kernel_launch_params(query_stride, 512 >> log_rows_per_query);\n    block.y = 1 << log_rows_per_query;\n    size_t shared_stride = block.x * div_ceil(block.y, 2);\n    size_t shmem_bytes = CELLS_OUT * shared_stride * sizeof(Fp);\n    auto height = query_stride << log_rows_per_query;\n\n    poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes_kernel<<<grid, block, shmem_bytes>>>(\n        out, matrix, width, height, query_stride, log_rows_per_query\n    );\n    return CHECK_KERNEL();\n}\n```\n\n**Rust FFI Wrapper:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/merkle_tree.rs` (lines 52-68)\n```rust\npub unsafe fn poseidon2_compressing_row_hashes(\n    out: &mut DeviceBuffer<Digest>,\n    matrix: &DeviceBuffer<F>,\n    width: usize,\n    query_stride: usize,\n    log_rows_per_query: usize,\n) -> Result<(), CudaError>\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. MERKLE TREE CONSTRUCTION\n\n**File:** `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/merkle_tree.rs`\n\n**Main Entry Point:** Lines 105-111\n```rust\npub fn new_with_hash<MH: MerkleTreeConstructor>(\n    matrix: DeviceMatrix<F>,\n    rows_per_query: usize,\n    cache_backing_matrix: bool,\n) -> Result<Self, MerkleTreeError>\n```\n\n**Generic Constructor:** Lines 113-172 (`new_generic_with_hash`)\n```rust\nfn new_generic_with_hash<MH: GpuMerkleHash<Digest = D>>(\n    matrix: DeviceMatrix<F>,\n    rows_per_query: usize,\n    cache_backing_matrix: bool,\n) -> Result<Self, MerkleTreeError> {\n    let query_stride = height / rows_per_query;  // Dimension calculation\n    \n    // Phase 1: Row hashing (LINE 130-138)\n    unsafe {\n        MH::compress_rows(\n            &mut query_digest_layer,\n            matrix.buffer(),\n            matrix.width(),      // # columns\n            query_stride,        // # independent row-hashes\n            log2_strict_usize(rows_per_query),  // tree depth\n        )\n        .map_err(MerkleTreeError::CompressingRowHashes)?;\n    }\n    \