`cuda\n  dim3 reduce_grid(num_airs, num_x);\n  batched_final_reduce_block_sums<<<reduce_grid, reduce_block, reduce_shmem>>>(\n      tmp_sums, output, air_block_offsets, num_x\n  );\n  ```\n\n**Rust FFI Binding** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 494-504):\n```rust\nfn _zerocheck_monomial_batched(\n    tmp_sums: *mut EF,\n    output: *mut EF,\n    block_ctxs: *const BlockCtx,\n    air_ctxs: *const MonomialAirCtx,\n    air_block_offsets: *const u32,\n    num_blocks: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    num_airs: u32,\n    threads_per_block: u32,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Rust Public Wrapper** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 1218-1240):\n```rust\npub unsafe fn zerocheck_monomial_batched(\n    tmp_sums: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    output: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    block_ctxs: &DeviceBuffer<BlockCtx>,\n    air_ctxs: &DeviceBuffer<MonomialAirCtx>,\n    air_block_offsets: &DeviceBuffer<u32>,\n    num_blocks: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    num_airs: u32,\n    threads_per_block: u32,\n) -> Result<(), CudaError>\n```\n\n**Kernel Behavior** (lines 102-151):\n- Each block handles one `(air, x_int, y_block)` tuple\n- Block-wise encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block`\n- Each thread in block evaluates one monomial (`m = mono_block * threads_per_block + threadIdx.x`)\n- For each monomial with `num_vars` variables:\n  1. Evaluate product of variables: `product = ∏ eval_variable(var_i, row, ctx, height)`\n  2. Multiply by precomputed lambda combination: `product *= d_lambda_combinations[m]`\n  3. Apply `eq_xi` (only depends on y): `sum *= d_eq_xi[y_int]`\n- Block reduction via `sumcheck::block_reduce_sum()` (warp reduce → shared mem → final warp reduce)\n- Thread 0 of each block stores result: `tmp_sums[blockIdx.x * num_x + x_int]`\n\n**Data Read/Write**:\n- **Reads**: Monomial headers, variables (PackedVar), precomputed lambda combinations, all trace data (main, preprocessed, public, selectors), eq_xi\n- **Writes**: `tmp_sums` (intermediate buffer), then `output` (final reduced sums)\n\n---\n\n### 2. ZEROCHECK MONOMIAL PAR-Y KERNEL\n\n**CUDA Kernel Signature** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`, lines 198-256):\n```cuda\n__global__ void zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ tmp_sums,\n    const BlockCtx *__restrict__ block_ctxs,\n    const MonomialAirCtx *__restrict__ air_ctxs,\n    uint32_t threads_per_block,\n    uint32_t chunk_size         // monomials per mono_chunk\n)\n```\n\n**Launch Parameters** (lines 274-294):\n- Grid: `(num_blocks, num_x)` where blocks are arranged as `(y_block, mono_chunk)`\n- Block: `(threads_per_block,)` — typically 128 threads\n- Shared memory: `ceil(threads_per_block / 32) * sizeof(FpExt)`\n- **Phase 1**:\n  ```cuda\n  dim3 grid(num_blocks, num_x);\n  dim3 block(threads_per_block);\n  size_t shmem = div_ceil(block.x, WARP_SIZE) * sizeof(FpExt);\n  zerocheck_monomial_par_y_kernel<<<grid, block, shmem>>>(\n      tmp_sums, block_ctxs, air_ctxs, threads_per_block, chunk_size\n  );\n  ```\n- **Phase 2**: Same reduction as zerocheck_monomial_kernel\n\n**Rust FFI Binding** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 506-517):\n```rust\nfn _zerocheck_monomial_par_y_batched(\n    tmp_sums: *mut EF,\n    output: *mut EF,\n    block_ctxs: *const BlockCtx,\n    air_ctxs: *const MonomialAirCtx,\n    air_block_offsets: *const u32,\n    num_blocks: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    num_airs: u32,\n    chunk_size: u32,\n    threads_per_block: u32,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Rust Public Wrapper** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 1243-1267):\n```rust\npub unsafe fn zerocheck_monomial_par_y_batched(\n    tmp_sums: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    output: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    block_ctxs: &DeviceBuffer<BlockCtx>,\n    air_ctxs: &DeviceBuffer<MonomialAirCtx>,\n    air_block_offsets: &DeviceBuffer<u32>,\n    num_blocks: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    num_airs: u32,\n    chunk_size: u32,\n    threads_per_block: u32,\n) -> Result<(), CudaError>\n```\n\n**Kernel Behavior** (lines 198-256):\n- **Optimization for high `num_y` traces**: Each thread handles one `y_int`, loops over contiguous monomial chunk\n- Block-wise encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_block * air_mono_chunks + mono_chunk`\n- Thread position: `y_int = threadIdx.x + y_block * threads_per_block`\n- For active threads (`y_int < num_y`):\n  1. Loop over monomial chunk: `for m in [mono_start, mono_end)`\n  2. For each monomial: evaluate product and multiply by combination\n  3. Accumulate: `sum += product * d_lambda_combinations[m]`\n  4. Apply eq_xi: `sum *= d_eq_xi[y_int]`\n- Block reduction across y_int values\n- Thread 0 stores: `tmp_sums[blockIdx.x * num_x + x_int]`\n\n**Chunk Size Auto-Tuning** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`, lines 342-368):\n- Computes `chunk_size` based on SM count and `num_x` to achieve target block count\n- Default max: 64 monomials per thread, target 4 waves per SM\n\n---\n\n### 3. LOGUP MONOMIAL KERNEL (Template: IS_DENOM)\n\n**CUDA Kernel Signature** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`, lines 303-327 and 393-442):\n```cuda\ntemplate <bool IS_DENOM>\n__global__ void precompute_logup_combinations_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ out,\n    const MonomialHeader *__restrict__ headers,\n    const InteractionMonomialTerm *__restrict__ terms,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ beta_pows,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ eq_3bs,\n    uint32_t num_monomials\n)\n\ntemplate <bool IS_DENOM>\n__global__ void logup_monomial_kernel(\n    FracExt *__restrict__ tmp_sums,\n    const BlockCtx *__restrict__ block_ctxs,\n    const LogupMonomialCommonCtx *__restrict__ common_ctxs,\n    const LogupMonomialCtx *__restrict__ ctxs\n)\n```\n\n**Launch Parameters for Precompute** (lines 340-364):\n```cuda\nconstexpr uint32_t threads = 256;\nuint32_t blocks = div_ceil(num_monomials, threads);\n\n// Numerator (IS_DENOM=false):\nprecompute_logup_combinations_kernel<false><<<blocks, threads>>>(\n    out, headers, terms, nullptr, eq_3bs, num_monomials\n);\n\n// Denominator (IS_DENOM=true):\nprecompute_logup_combinations_kernel<true><<<blocks, threads>>>(\n    out, headers, terms, beta_pows, eq_3bs, num_monomials\n);\n```\n\n**Launch Parameters for MLE Kernel** (lines 460-494):\n```cuda\ndim3 grid(num_blocks, num_x);\ndim3 block(threads_per_block);  // 128 threads typical\nsize_t shmem = div_ceil(threads_per_block, WARP_SIZE) * sizeof(FpExt);\n\n// Phase 1a: Numerator\nlogup_monomial_kernel<false><<<grid, block, shmem>>>(\n    tmp_sums, block_ctxs, common_ctxs, numer_ctxs\n);\n\n// Phase 1b: Denominator\nlogup_monomial_kernel<true><<<grid, block, shmem>>>(\n    tmp_sums, block_ctxs, common_ctxs, denom_ctxs\n);\n\n// Phase 2: Reduction (treats FracExt as 2×FpExt)\ndim3 reduce_grid(num_airs, 2 * num_x);\nbatched_final_reduce_block_sums<<<reduce_grid, reduce_block, reduce_shmem>>>(\n    reinterpret_cast<FpExt *>(tmp_sums),\n    reinterpret_cast<FpExt *>(output),\n    air_block_offsets,\n    2 * num_x\n);\n```\n\n**Rust FFI Bindings** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 528-557):\n```rust\nfn _precompute_logup_numer_combinations(\n    out: *mut EF,\n    headers: *const MonomialHeader,\n    terms: *const InteractionMonomialTerm<F>,\n    eq_3bs: *const EF,\n    num_monomials: u32,\n) -> i32;\n\nfn _precompute_logup_denom_combinations(\n    out: *mut EF,\n    headers: *const MonomialHeader,\n    terms: *const InteractionMonomialTerm<F>,\n    beta_pows: *const EF,\n    eq_3bs: *const EF,\n    num_monomials: u32,\n) -> i32;\n\nfn _logup_monomial_batched(\n    tmp_sums: *mut Frac<EF>,\n    output: *mut Frac<EF>,\n    block_ctxs: *const BlockCtx,\n    common_ctxs: *const LogupMonomialCommonCtx,\n    numer_ctxs: *const LogupMonomialCtx,\n    denom_ctxs: *const LogupMonomialCtx,\n    air_block_offsets: *const u32,\n    num_blocks: u32,\n    num_x: u32,\n    num_airs: u32,\n    threads_per_block: u32,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Rust Public Wrappers** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 1285-1346):\n```rust\npub unsafe fn precompute_logup_numer_combinations(...)\npub unsafe fn precompute_logup_denom_combinations(...)\npub unsafe fn logup_monomial_batched(...)\n```\n\n**Kernel Behavior for logup_monomial_kernel** (lines 393-442):\n- Block encoding: `local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block`\n- Each thread evaluates one monomial chunk\n- Monomial evaluation:\n  1. Start with precomputed combination: `monomial = d_combinations[m]`\n  2. Multiply by all variables: `monomial *= eval_variable(var_i, row, ctx, height)`\n  3. Apply eq_xi: `sum = monomial * d_eq_xi[y_int]`\n- Block reduction\n- **Conditional writes**:\n  - **IS_DENOM=false** (numerator): `tmp_sums[...].p = reduced`\n  - **IS_DENOM=true** (denominator): \n    - `tmp_sums[...].q = reduced`\n    - **Special case** (mono_block == 0): adds `bus_term_sum * d_eq_xi[y_int]` to denominator\n\n---\n\n### 4. PRECOMPUTE LAMBDA COMBINATIONS KERNEL\n\n**CUDA Kernel Signature** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`, lines 60-78):\n```cuda\n__global__ void precompute_lambda_combinations_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ out,\n    const MonomialHeader *__restrict__ headers,\n    const LambdaTerm *__restrict__ lambda_terms,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ lambda_pows,\n    uint32_t num_monomials\n)\n```\n\n**Launch Parameters** (lines 80-96):\n```cuda\nconstexpr uint32_t threads = 256;\nuint32_t blocks = div_ceil(num_monomials, threads);\nprecompute_lambda_combinations_kernel<<<blocks, threads>>>(\n    out, headers, lambda_terms, lambda_pows, num_monomials\n);\n```\n\n**Rust FFI Binding** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 519-525):\n```rust\nfn _precompute_lambda_combinations(\n    out: *mut EF,\n    headers: *const MonomialHeader,\n    lambda_terms: *const LambdaTerm<F>,\n    lambda_pows: *const EF,\n    num_monomials: u32,\n) -> i32;\n```\n\n**Rust Public Wrapper** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 1269-1283):\n```rust\npub unsafe fn precompute_lambda_combinations(\n    out: &mut DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    headers: *const MonomialHeader,\n    lambda_terms: *const LambdaTerm<F>,\n    lambda_pows: &DeviceBuffer<EF>,\n    num_monomials: u32,\n) -> Result<(), CudaError>\n```\n\n**Kernel Behavior** (lines 60-78):\n- Each thread processes one monomial (`m = blockIdx.x * blockDim.x + threadIdx.x`)\n- For each monomial:\n  1. Load header: `MonomialHeader hdr = headers[m]`\n  2. Sum over lambda terms: `for l in [0, num_terms): sum += lambda_pows[constraint_idx_l] * coefficient_l`\n  3. Store: `out[m] = sum`\n\n---\n\n### 5. DESCRIPTOR STRUCTURES\n\n**BlockCtx** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 17-22):\n```rust\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct BlockCtx {\n    pub local_block_idx_x: u32,  // Encodes (y_int, mono_block) or (y_block, mono_chunk)\n    pub air_idx: u32,             // Local AIR index within batch\n}\n```\n\n**MonomialAirCtx** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 27-35):\n```rust\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct MonomialAirCtx {\n    pub d_headers: *const MonomialHeader,\n    pub d_variables: *const PackedVar,\n    pub d_lambda_combinations: *const EF,  // Precomputed per-monomial\n    pub num_monomials: u32,\n    pub eval_ctx: EvalCoreCtx,\n    pub d_eq_xi: *const EF,\n    pub num_y: u32,\n}\n```\n\n**EvalCoreCtx** (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`, lines 39-44):\n```rust\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct EvalCoreCtx {\n    pub d_selectors: *const EF,             