d/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`):\n\nFor `ZerocheckMonomialBatch::new()` (lines 127-217):\n```rust\n// Build block_ctxs encoding: local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block\n// For each AIR: mono_blocks = ceil(num_monomials / threads_per_block)\n//               total_blocks = mono_blocks * num_y\n// Upload EvalCoreCtx with main_ptrs_dev, sels_ptr, prep_ptr, public_ptr\n// Upload MonomialAirCtx with monomial headers, variables, precomputed lambda combinations\n```\n\nFor `ZerocheckMonomialParYBatch::new()` (lines 303-441):\n```rust\n// Build block_ctxs encoding: local_block_idx_x = y_block * air_mono_chunks + mono_chunk\n// Auto-tune chunk_size based on SM count and num_x\n// For each AIR: y_blocks = ceil(num_y / threads_per_block)\n//               air_mono_chunks = ceil(num_monomials / chunk_size)\n//               blocks_for_air = y_blocks * air_mono_chunks\n```\n\nFor `LogupMonomialBatch::new()` (lines 607-741):\n```rust\n// Build block_ctxs encoding: local_block_idx_x = y_int * mono_blocks + mono_block\n// mono_blocks = ceil(max(num_numer_monomials, num_denom_monomials) / threads_per_block)\n// Upload common_ctxs with bus_term_sum precomputed on CPU\n// Upload separate numer_ctxs and denom_ctxs for precomputed combinations\n```\n\n---\n\n### 7. EXISTING BATCHED KERNEL PATTERN\n\nThe established batching infrastructure is demonstrated in `zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel` (`/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle.cu`, lines 109-204):\n\n```cuda\n__global__ void zerocheck_batch_mle_kernel(\n    FpExt *__restrict__ tmp_sums_buffer,\n    const BlockCtx *__restrict__ d_block_ctxs,\n    const ZerocheckCtx *__restrict__ d_zc_ctxs,\n    const FpExt *__restrict__ d_lambda_pows,\n    size_t lambda_len\n)\n```\n\n**Pattern**:\n1. Grid dimension: `(num_blocks, num_x)` — different AIRs in different blocks\n2. Each block loads its AIR index via `BlockCtx`: `air_idx = d_block_ctxs[blockIdx.x].air_idx`\n3. Per-AIR context loaded: `ZerocheckCtx zc_ctx = d_zc_ctxs[block_ctx.air_idx]`\n4. Thread-level work: `y_int = threadIdx.x + block_ctx.local_block_idx_x * blockDim.x`\n5. Two-phase execution:\n   - Phase 1: Evaluate constraints/monomials, store in `tmp_sums` (size `num_blocks * num_x`)\n   - Phase 2: Reduction across blocks per AIR using `batched_final_reduce_block_sums` with `air_block_offsets`\n\n**Key insight**: `air_block_offsets[air_idx]` and `air_block_offsets[air_idx+1]` define the block range for each AIR, enabling per-AIR final reduction in a single kernel launch with grid `(num_airs, num_x)`.\n\n---\n\n### File Paths Summary\n\n- **Monomial kernels (CUDA)**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.cu`\n- **FFI bindings**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`\n- **Batch builders**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/batch_mle_monomial.rs`\n- **Batch orchestration**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs`\n- **Monomial data structures**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/include/monomial.cuh`\n- **Helper functions**: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-common/include/launcher.cuh`, `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/include/sumcheck.cuh`"}],"totalDurationMs":112062,"totalTokens":67525,"totalToolUseCount":46,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2353,"cache_read_input_tokens":58293,"output_tokens":6879,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2353},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":6879,"cache_read_input_tokens":58293,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2353,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":14,"search