{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MT9jCZSKT2DnhPCepGg24B","type":"tool_result","content":"163\t\n164\t### Change 4: Restructure `log_gkr_input_evals` to separate SCATTER and GLOBAL AIRs\n165\t\n166\t**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.rs`\n167\t\n168\tAfter building and sorting work_items (line 252), partition by mode:\n169\t\n170\t```rust\n171\t// Separate SCATTER and GLOBAL work items (preserving height-sorted order within each group)\n172\tlet mut scatter_indices: Vec<usize> = Vec::new();\n173\tlet mut global_indices: Vec<usize> = Vec::new();\n174\tfor (idx, w) in work_items.iter().enumerate() {\n175\t    if w.pk_air.other_data.interaction_rules.inner.buffer_size <= 10 {\n176\t        scatter_indices.push(idx);\n177\t    } else {\n178\t        global_indices.push(idx);\n179\t    }\n180\t}\n181\t```\n182\t\n183\tBuild SCATTER descriptor arrays (main thread, before spawning workers):\n184\t```rust\n185\t// Build BlockCtx and GkrInputScatterCtx for all SCATTER AIRs\n186\tlet mut block_ctxs: Vec<BlockCtx> = Vec::new();\n187\tlet mut air_ctxs: Vec<GkrInputScatterCtx> = Vec::new();\n188\tfor (air_local_idx, &work_idx) in scatter_indices.iter().enumerate() {\n189\t    let w = &work_items[work_idx];\n190\t    let height = w.air_ctx.height() as u32;\n191\t    let num_air_blocks = height.div_ceil(256);\n192\t\n193\t    for local_block in 0..num_air_blocks {\n194\t        block_ctxs.push(BlockCtx {\n195\t            local_block_idx_x: local_block,\n196\t            air_idx: air_local_idx as u32,\n197\t        });\n198\t    }\n199\t\n200\t    // Build per-AIR context (collecting pointers from existing data structures)\n201\t    air_ctxs.push(GkrInputScatterCtx { /* fields from work item */ });\n202\t}\n203\tlet d_block_ctxs = block_ctxs.to_device()?;\n204\tlet d_air_ctxs = air_ctxs.to_device()?;\n205\tlet total_scatter_blocks = block_ctxs.len() as u32;\n206\t```\n207\t\n208\tModify the multi-threaded section to only process GLOBAL AIRs:\n209\t```rust\n210\t// Adjust num_threads based on GLOBAL count (not total)\n211\tlet mut num_threads = if global_indices.len() >= 100 {\n212\t    NUM_GKR_INPUT_STREAMS.min(global_indices.len())\n213\t} else if global_indices.is_empty() {\n214\t    0\n215\t} else {\n216\t    1\n217\t};\n218\t// ... memory budget check on GLOBAL-only buffer sizes ...\n219\t```\n220\t\n221\t### Change 5: Launch SCATTER batch on background thread\n222\t\n223\t**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.rs`\n224\t\n225\tInside the `std::thread::scope` block, add a background thread for SCATTER batch:\n226\t\n227\t```rust"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01WVgYuHXQhJGV2tfoj6TCzi","session_id":"d4314f39-e91d-47fe-87bd-a8908ed81e1e","uuid":"efac79db-bb43-4870-99c3-3f37d01cc097","timestamp":"2026-04-14T09:17:35.046Z"}
