{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ASdHkJiPSp3BhWnZk4TF1q","type":"tool_result","content":"96\t**File**: `crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/gkr_input.rs`\n97\t\n98\tThe per-AIR `partition_ptrs` (Vec<u64> of device pointers to trace partitions) and `public_values` (Vec<F>) currently require per-AIR H2D uploads in `process_gkr_input_air`. For the batched path, concatenate all SCATTER AIRs' data into two flat host arrays, perform 2 bulk H2D uploads, and store per-AIR offsets.\n99\t\n100\t```rust\n101\t// Phase 1b: Build concatenated host arrays for SCATTER AIRs\n102\tlet mut all_partition_ptrs: Vec<u64> = Vec::new();\n103\tlet mut all_public_values: Vec<F> = Vec::new();\n104\tlet mut scatter_partition_offsets: Vec<usize> = Vec::new();\n105\tlet mut scatter_pv_offsets: Vec<usize> = Vec::new();\n106\t\n107\tfor &work_idx in &scatter_indices {\n108\t    let w = &work_items[work_idx];\n109\t    let air_ctx = w.air_ctx;\n110\t\n111\t    // Partition pointers\n112\t    scatter_partition_offsets.push(all_partition_ptrs.len());\n113\t    for committed in &air_ctx.cached_mains {\n114\t        all_partition_ptrs.push(committed.trace.buffer().as_ptr() as u64);\n115\t    }\n116\t    all_partition_ptrs.push(air_ctx.common_main.buffer().as_ptr() as u64);\n117\t\n118\t    // Public values\n119\t    scatter_pv_offsets.push(all_public_values.len());\n120\t    all_public_values.extend_from_slice(&air_ctx.public_values);\n121\t}\n122\t\n123\t// 2 bulk H2D uploads (vs ~305 individual uploads in current approach)\n124\tlet d_all_partition_ptrs = all_partition_ptrs.to_device()?;\n125\tlet d_all_public_values = if all_public_values.is_empty() {\n126\t    DeviceBuffer::new()\n127\t} else {\n128\t    all_public_values.to_device()?\n129\t};\n130\t```\n131\t\n132\tEach `GkrInputScatterCtx.d_main` points to `d_all_partition_ptrs.as_ptr().add(scatter_partition_offsets[i])`, and `d_public_values` points to `d_all_public_values.as_ptr().add(scatter_pv_offsets[i])` (or null if empty).\n133\t\n134\t### Change 3: Handle lifting for SCATTER AIRs\n135\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_019drUhnLnZVuh4yqgaLTUU7","session_id":"d4314f39-e91d-47fe-87bd-a8908ed81e1e","uuid":"870c1c80-da3d-4c7b-8191-5e31e93467ef","timestamp":"2026-04-14T09:22:34.781Z"}
